# Look of the enemies' moves (decision 16; PR #789 reactions, then the charge), video takes for the user's
# acceptance: a 1H master dodges the hero's running swing in light, medium and heavy armour (dash, roll, heavy
# roll), charges (hit, dodged, parried), and a bandit fights a guard (dodges between NPCs). The riposte and the
# shoulder barge left the game on 2026-11-14 (plan decisions 19 and 20), their takes with them. Every take starts
# both at the same sunlit spot 16 m into the field from the fixture (the fixture's own spot lies in a tree's shadow
# at noon).
# Only takes whose bench.log line says "at <ms> ms of PC_HERO's swing" show a reaction to the swing; "now, no
# swing" is the old post-hit jump-back trigger.
# WORLD=NEWWORLD.ZEN BENCH_HOST=ryzen OPENGOTHIC_BODY_TRACE=1 TIMEOUT=900 TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1280x720
# OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=/abs/content-staging/anim-strikes
seed 73013
set time 12 0
release all
overlay off
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
wait 500
watch player
clear 3000
corner right go 0
melee-shadow setup 1h
stats hp 1000000 hpmax 1000000 str 100 1h 100 talent auto
wait 600
melee-shadow target 2
wait 600
pin WOLF 5000 90 0
wait 34
pin off
pin WOLF 5000 -90 0
wait 34
pin off
turn 180
immortal player on
still player on
immortal BDT_1013_BANDIT_L on
wait 2000
stats npc BDT_1013_BANDIT_L str 60 1h 100 2h 100 talent auto
put BDT_1013_BANDIT_L 300 0
melee-shadow bandit 1h
wait 1000
cam two BDT_1013_BANDIT_L 400 60 1

